Description: Neural-network network intrusion detection and live traffic classification
 SynapseIDS converts captured or replayed traffic into versioned bidirectional
 flow features, classifies those flows with neural-network models, and streams
 every result to a live web UI. This package contains three static binaries:
 .
   synapsed         the capture / flow / feature / inference daemon and API
   synapse          the administrative CLI (talks to a running synapsed)
   synapse-sensor   placeholder for the Phase 6 distributed capture agent
 .
 The management API binds to localhost by default. This build classifies PCAP
 replays with a transparent rule-based model; trained ONNX models arrive in a
 later release. For authorized defensive monitoring, lab analysis and research.
